# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment files. Never commit real secrets. .env.example may be committed
# as a non-secret template; everything else stays local.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local design-doc scratch. LLM-exported language-agnostic research and
# similar working artifacts that live in docs/ for reference but don't need
# to be tracked. Architecture writeups and v05-research/ stay committed.
docs/*.docx
docs/claudelanguageagnostic.md

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Local scratch for drafts and working artifacts. Nothing in here is reviewed,
# and a discarded draft that failed fact-checking must never be one `git add .`
# away from being published. Keep it out of the tree entirely.
.scratch/
